{"name": "Bobls", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"270\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459890/extras/c34545e81779c854eaeb727326069b29.poster.avif?t=1781082884\" width=\"720\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459890/extras/c34545e81779c854eaeb727326069b29.webm?t=1781082884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bobls is a bouncy precision platformer.</strong> Blow and bounce on bubbles as you collect magical gemstones in hundreds of fun and challenging levels. Play solo or join forces with Mousr in the co-op campaign, carefully coordinating your moves as you solve mind-bending puzzles. Or create and share your own levels with the world!  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>--&gt; Share your level codes on our Discord or play other people's creations &lt;--</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459890/extras_big/1ed0d3a1e06615ec6cfad5b453e74341.avif?t=1781082884\" height=\"49\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459890/extras/1ed0d3a1e06615ec6cfad5b453e74341.avif?t=1781082884\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bubbles play a central role in your adventure. Use them to maneuver difficult terrain, collect useful items, and press inaccessible buttons as you bounce through levels. Slide down slopes at thrilling speeds and build combos as you venture through the increasingly challenging worlds. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"270\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459890/extras/ff947dff03ac6a49cd81907b561f1689.poster.avif?t=1781082884\" width=\"720\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459890/extras/ff947dff03ac6a49cd81907b561f1689.webm?t=1781082884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459890/extras_big/994d8a4d2a0dec3c01c263036f90260d.avif?t=1781082884\" height=\"49\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459890/extras/994d8a4d2a0dec3c01c263036f90260d.avif?t=1781082884\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as Bobls and Mousr in the local co-op campaign which features an entire new set of dedicated levels. The teamwork dynamic shifts mechanics in interesting new ways and puts your relationship to the test. Blow bubbles for the other player to bounce on and toggle platforms for each other, or die trying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"270\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459890/extras/98d523e192c782d6ffff689e71a970c6.poster.avif?t=1781082884\" width=\"720\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459890/extras/98d523e192c782d6ffff689e71a970c6.webm?t=1781082884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459890/extras_big/4bb6cbcdf4e46cdbe9f60e2265a564b9.avif?t=1781082884\" height=\"49\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459890/extras/4bb6cbcdf4e46cdbe9f60e2265a564b9.avif?t=1781082884\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Let your imagination run wild in the powerful level editor and share your creations with the rest of the world. The editor lets you play with easy-to-use tools that make your ideas come to life in no time. Discover new levels created by players through the online hub, the Level Galaxy. Race against replay ghosts and perfect your moves to make your way to the top of the leaderboard! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"270\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459890/extras/2be42f961855675b05505ea379e0c334.poster.avif?t=1781082884\" width=\"720\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459890/extras/2be42f961855675b05505ea379e0c334.webm?t=1781082884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459890/extras_big/feed255f1165c4095be4f1ffa366ef4e.avif?t=1781082884\" height=\"49\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459890/extras/feed255f1165c4095be4f1ffa366ef4e.avif?t=1781082884\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Single-player campaign with multiple worlds and hundreds of levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Separate two-player local co-op campaign tailored to teamwork</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play, create, and share your own levels in the social Online Universe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Replayability modes - Complete the campaigns again with challenging twists</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A pixel perfect world with precise platforming mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Retro aesthetics but modern game design principles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Original, head-banging soundtrack</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<br/>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"270\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459890/extras/440da8ef9ecf5af773175befc4059a26.poster.avif?t=1781082884\" width=\"720\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459890/extras/440da8ef9ecf5af773175befc4059a26.webm?t=1781082884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Bobls is a tight precision platformer with hundreds of handcrafted levels, a dedicated co-op campaign, endless community-made challenges, and a powerful level editor. Blow and bounce on bubbles to build speed, chain combos, and chase that perfect run.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459890/header.jpg?t=1781082884", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Precision Platformer", "Difficult", "Level Editor", "Local Co-Op", "2D", "Co-op"], "developers": "Softlock Interactive", "publishers": "Softlock Interactive", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "2459890", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "3 February 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/IKUkUzQ_Shg", "first_seen": 1770073200.0, "review_rank": 1286}